      "id": "kst.t12",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The wheel slip monitor's alert threshold is 6.8% slip. Alerts are evaluated over a rolling traction sample rather than a single reading.",
        "d": "The wheel slip monitor includes locomotive speed and traction state in each alert so fleet staff can review the conditions."
      },
      "query": "What is the wheel slip monitor's alert threshold?"
